---
title: Checkout
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer
    participant Shop
    participant Bank as Payment provider
    Buyer->>+Shop: Place the order
    Shop->>Bank: Charge the card
    alt Card accepted
        Bank-->>Shop: Approved
        Shop-->>Buyer: Order confirmed
    else Card declined
        Bank-->>Shop: Declined
        Shop-->>Buyer: Try another card
    end
    deactivate Shop
    Note over Buyer,Shop: The receipt is sent by email
